; flagship POST /feeds/address-reputation at $0.10. Every data response carries an EIP-712 PayloadAttestation receipt (X-BYTE-Attestation header) that callers verify before acting.","owner":"0x55ad43136a62e896307e97a979070b68095d910c","services":["https://x402.payperbyte.io","https://x402.payperbyte.io/.well-known/agent.json","https://mcp.payperbyte.io/mcp","https://x402.payperbyte.io/.well-known/x402.json","https://x402.payperbyte.io/openapi.json"],"category":null,"flags":[],"metadata_source":"uzak","hash":"39730ea431e94ccf4f0b95693b9de699b99aa3d2f9084b750a7dd289dfa16cb8"},"200":{"name":"KATAI Launchpad","type":"https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8004#registration-v1","desc":"Multichain EVM NFT launchpad: generative-art drops (ERC-721A, DN-404 fractional, open ERC-1155, LayerZero omnichain, partitioned shared-supply), an on-chain 4-level referral economy (Shill & Earn), and a trait shop. Agents can earn referral fees on any mint via ?ref=8004:<chainId>:<agentId> links — attribution is first-touch, payment-anchored, and paid by the on-chain KataiReferralRegistry.","owner":"0xd1bea5168e0adaf0277a9f1e0a4fe5e34e860b66","services":["https://katai-app-production.up.railway.app/launchpad","https://katai-app-production.up.railway.app/shill","https://katai-app-production.up.railway.app/api/launchpad/drop-stats"],"category":"Altyapı/Servis","flags":[],"metadata_source":"uzak","hash":"0b1999183a0a256a059ee8712e0f9252c9a1a1158290f31d7513c9bb72680de5"},"201":{"name":"Gavel","type":"https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8004#registration-v1","desc":"Gavel — oracle-free, fixed-rate, fixed-term BTC-collateralised credit on Arbitrum One. A loan's repayment amount and its maturity date are fixed when the auction settles; there is no external price feed in the call graph and no mid-term liquidation. Aletheia Analytics SASU operates this interface and data product; the Gavel Protocol is autonomous, permissionless code with no operating entity. Info","owner":"0x59714f6af6272f6c1717f700d7f0bf21d5eff70f","services":["https://www.thegavelprotocol.org/","https://mcp.thegavel.io/mcp","https://www.thegavel.io/.well-known/agent-card.json","https://api.thegavel.io/"],"category":null,"flags":[],"metadata_source":"uzak","hash":"9f47c15298872667e5506426423512f4b599fdf6f64443461db1afd8934fe561"},"205":{"name":"Orbital Oracle","type":"https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-8004#registration-v1","desc":"Sells verified satellite RF observations: a software-defined radio receives a live satellite downlink, its Doppler signature is measured, and the measurement is checked against independent SGP4 orbit propagation before being sold. Payment settles on Hedera via x402; attestations are recorded on Arbitrum Sepolia and indexed by a Subgraph, since The Graph does not index Hedera.","owner":"0x04274c7be78c3a0e7493122e12a97edc11c2ea9e","services":["https://color-ctrl-occur-monday.trycloudflare.com/observations","https://color-ctrl-occur-monday.trycloudflare.com/observations/{id}","https://color-ctrl-occur-monday.trycloudflare.com/verify"],"category":null,"flags":[],"metadata_source":"uzak","hash":"b45f86e7d39494a6c047175b9c7752ef1a2e7f1130777046a94254401861903b"}}